   "name": "machine-swapper",
   "title": "Machine Swapper",
   "summary": "Easily change which machine category is required to craft any recipe using a built-in GUI! The perfect, fully compatible companion to the Recipe Tweaker mod.",
   "description": "**AI disclosure:** this mod was made with the help of AI (Claude by Anthropic).\r\n\r\nHave you ever wanted to bake a transport belt in a furnace or assemble an iron gear wheel in a chemical plant? With **Machine Swapper**, now you can!\r\n\r\nThis mod allows you to easily change the **crafting machine category** of any recipe through a convenient, in-game graphical interface.\r\n\r\n## ✨ Features\r\n\r\n* **In-game Interactive GUI:** Easily swap machine categories on the fly. Modified recipes appear in a clear table where you can left-click to edit them again, or right-click to delete them from your list.\r\n* **Visual Feedback:** The drop-down menu displays the icon of the base machine for each category (e.g., Assembling machine, Furnace) so you know exactly what you are choosing.\r\n* **Smart Export & Import System:** Generate an exchange string via the GUI and paste it into the mod's Startup settings to apply your changes safely.\r\n* **Safety First:** Built-in protection against game-breaking modifications (such as blocking the modification of the rocket part).\r\n* **Automatic Chat Notifications:** Upon loading a save, the mod briefly lists your currently active category swaps in the chat.\r\n* **Perfect Harmony with Recipe Tweaker:** Designed to be the perfect companion to the popular **Recipe Tweaker** mod without loading conflicts. Use both to take complete control over your production chains!\r\n\r\n*(Note: Since the Factorio engine does not allow changing recipe properties in real-time, applying new machine swaps requires pasting the generated code into the Startup settings and restarting the game).*\r\n\r\n### 🌍 Languages\r\n* **English:** This mod includes full English translation. \r\n* **Magyar:** A mod teljes magyar nyelvi támogatással rendelkezik!",
   "changelog": "---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVersion: 1.0.4\nDate: 2026-10-24\n  Info:\n    - Release for Factorio 2.1.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVersion: 1.0.3\nDate: 2026-10-24\n  Changes:\n    - Exchange strings are now compressed. Strings from earlier versions are not compatible.\n  Info:\n    - Release for Factorio 2.0.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVersion: 1.0.2\nDate: 2026-10-24\n  Info:\n    - Release for Factorio 1.1.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVersion: 1.0.1\nDate: 2026-10-24\n  Info:\n    - Release for Factorio 1.0.\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVersion: 1.0.0\nDate: 2026-10-24\n  Features:\n    - In-game GUI (Ctrl + M or the shortcut bar) to choose which machine category crafts a recipe.\n    - Generate Code creates an exchange string; paste it into the startup setting to apply the swaps.\n  Info:\n    - Release for Factorio 0.17.\n",
