   "name": "uranium_geiger_continued",
   "title": "Uranium Geiger [Fork]",
   "summary": "Adds a geiger counter sound effect when close to uranium ore. Fork of Uranium Geiger by ikornaselur, updated for Factorio 2.1.",
   "description": "**AI disclosure:** this mod was made with the help of AI (Claude by Anthropic).\r\n\r\n# Uranium Geiger [Fork]\r\n\r\nHear a geiger counter ticking when you get close to uranium ore. The closer you are, the more intense the ticking.\r\n\r\nThis is a fork of [Uranium Geiger](https://mods.factorio.com/mod/uranium_geiger) by **ikornaselur**, updated for **Factorio 2.1**. All credit for the original idea, code and sounds goes to the original author.\r\n\r\n## Features\r\n- Three levels of geiger ticks: distant, middle and close\r\n- Adjustable ranges (map settings) and per-player volumes (player settings)\r\n- Works in multiplayer for every connected player\r\n- Can be installed next to the original mod without conflicts\r\n\r\n## Changes from the original\r\n- Updated for Factorio 2.1\r\n- Works for all connected players, not only the first one\r\n- Fixed: the distant volume setting is now used for distant ticks\r\n- Setting and sound names are prefixed, so the two mods don't clash\r\n\r\n## License\r\nMIT, same as the original. The original copyright notice is kept in the LICENSE file.\r\n\r\n## Note to the original author\r\nThis fork exists only because the original isn't available for 2.1 yet. **If ikornaselur asks me to, I will take this mod down**, for example if the original gets a 2.1 update or if they simply prefer that this fork doesn't exist. Feel free to contact me through the discussion tab.",
   "changelog": "---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVersion: 0.6.0\nDate: 2026-10-16\n  Changes:\n    - Forked from Uranium Geiger 0.5.1 by ikornaselur and updated for Factorio 2.1.\n",
